{"version":1,"content":"<p>【15：18更新】土瓜灣永耀街3號一唐樓單位發生傷人案件。</p><p>今早（17日）6時許，警方接獲報案，指上址單位一名43歲姓郭女住客應門時，遭6男女以釘槍及腳襲擊受傷，其間被盜去3000元現金及一部華爲電話，3男3女疑犯得手後逃去。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T07:39:58.663733+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:28:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T07:37:35.730795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T07:37:35.730795+00:00","content_hash":"65e2e91f5ba1293f52e157f18ab0413e83d27527fcf1c156a04c39018918bc26","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}